Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:44:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Apply horizon-free fork patches (offline play, unsigned
 launcher self-update) and add Linux release workflow

- launcher: force dev_offline so the game can be played without a Microsoft
  account that owns it
- launcher: fetch launcher updates from the fork's own repository and skip
  Horizon release-signature verification for self-update downloads
- .github/workflows/release-linux.yml: build the Linux launcher binary and
  publish it as a GitHub Release asset on release published or workflow dispatch
